            },
            {
              "kind": "insert_after",
              "paragraphId": "p0088",
              "text": "Notwithstanding the foregoing: (a) Sparkling retains all right, title and interest in and to Sparkling's data (including data converted under Section 4(b)) and all materials, information and specifications supplied by Sparkling, none of which is assigned or licensed to Garman except as reasonably necessary for Garman to perform its obligations under this Agreement; (b) Garman grants to Sparkling a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide, royalty-free licence to use the Modifications and the Improvements, and to modify them (itself or through a third party acting on its behalf), in the conduct of the business of Sparkling and its affiliated companies; and (c) nothing in this Agreement creates or is intended to create joint ownership of any intellectual property rights."
